        {
          "text": "Nami d'ukuba hama aka qomaat'a qabu ha woya ufi tarsaase, rifeensa isaa ginda tolfate, afaani duufate, lalabe, Anini qulqullooniti, Anini qulqullooniti jed'uuti! ",
