              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ammalle damansi sunini dottaate yokhaani diimate, inni damansa guddate amma waan ch'ufa qabachu jiru, tanaafi qaallu garsiisu malani. ",
