              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba eege qaallichi ilaale, yo damansi suni bifa jijirachu baate, ato guddachule baate, inni qulqullooniti, miha suni gubu maltani, ato damansi dura yokhaani duuba jiratele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
